gazJ(){return"Churn risk scores:\n\u2022 Negative balance: +30\n\u2022 Skipped (cancelled with deduction) >50%: +30\n\u2022 Skipped 30-50%: +15\n\u2022 Cancellations without deduction don't raise the risk\n\u2022 Few lessons (\u22642): +20\n\nHigh \u226550, Medium \u226525, Low >0\n\nStudents with a frozen subscription are shown as \u201cPaused\u201d instead of a risk score \u2014 they're on a planned pause, not at risk."},
